12. What is Pre-training?
Ans: means models are trained on massive dataset, blogs, website, content etc. and this is taken care by llm providers like openAI, anthropic, google etc.

13: what is post training?
Ans: Improves behavior and usefulness of a model after pre-training.
    In post training: after the pre training of an model , we have to do Supervised Fine-Tuning (SFT) on high-quality instruction → response examples.
    RLHF: Humans rank model responses, and the model is optimized toward preferred responses.
    Safety / Alignment training: Model is trained to follow safety policies, refuse inappropriate requests, follow instructions, etc.

14. What is RLHF?
Ans: RLHF = Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback
      RLHF एक technique है जिसमें इंसानों के feedback का इस्तेमाल करके LLM के responses को ज्यादा helpful, safe और human preference के according बनाया जाता है।
      RLHF क्यों किया जाता है?=> इससे model बेहतर हो सकता है
        Helpfulness, Safety, Response quality and alingment with human examples.
    Interview distinction
      Instruction tuning => इंसानों द्वारा बनाए गए good examples से model को सिखाते हैं कि अच्छा response कैसा होना चाहिए।
      RLHF => इंसानों से multiple responses की preference/ranking लेकर model को सिखाते हैं कि कौन-सा response बेहतर है।

